  "historyNote": "#4676, eff 9-20-89, EXPIRED: 9-20-95 New. #6232, eff 4-26-96; ss by #6881, eff 11-13-98; ss by #8621, eff 5-2-06; ss by #9886-B, eff 3-11-11, EXPIRED 3-11-2019 New. #14019, eff 9-6-24 (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Soil 300); ss by #14455, eff 2-8-26, EXPIRES: 2-8-36",
